{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777000/extras/Gif1_Header.gif?t=1751564788\" /></div><strong><br>Letters of War</strong> is a heartfelt 2D adventure that tells a touching story of loss, courage and great love. Based on the true story of the developer's grandmother, the game invites you into the world of Liam, a British carpenter who volunteered to go to the front to protect his family.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777000/extras/Gif2_War.gif?t=1751564788\" /></div><br> Become a participant in the most important battles of the Western Front of World War II - from mainland Italy, the mountain passes of Monte Cassino to Sword Beach (Normandy) - and go all the way as a soldier of the 8th British Army, whose merits have never been covered in such detail. At home, little Rosie is waiting for you - Liam's daughter, to whom you promised to return and who copes with loneliness in the rear with the help of her father's letters and the support of her mother.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777000/extras/Gif3_Girl.gif?t=1751564788\" /></div></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3777000?t=1751564788","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3777000?t=1751564788","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777000/3cdc6a9491920299ab81f58dda563d4453e0b631/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751564788","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777000/3cdc6a9491920299ab81f58dda563d4453e0b631/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751564788","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Shar